//   M[nch_hvn]      HV NMOS                     (PO*OD*NP-HVNWi*HVPWi*HVPSUB) 
//   M[nch_hvz]      HV native NMOS              (PO*OD*NP-HVNWi-HVPWi*HVPSUB) 
//   M[pch_hvp]      HV PMOS                     (PO*OD*PP*HVNWi-HVPWi-HVPSUB) 
//   D[ndio_cehv]    N+/HVPW DIODE               (DIODMY*OD*NP-HVNWi*HVPWi*HVPSUB) 
